(JUST ONE - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(A cooperative party game. Players help one player guess a mystery word by each writing) Tj T*
(a one-word clue. Identical clues cancel out, so be original. The team tries to guess) Tj T*
(as many of 13 cards as possible.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A ROUND) Tj T*
(1. The active player draws a card without looking at it and puts it on their easel,) Tj T*
(   facing the) Tj T*
(   others. They say a number from 1 to 5; that word is the mystery word.) Tj T*
(2. Every other player secretly writes one clue on their easel.) Tj T*
(3. Clue comparison: the active player closes their eyes. The others reveal their clues) Tj T*
(   and remove) Tj T*
(   identical or invalid clues.) Tj T*
(4. The active player sees the remaining clues and has one guess.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
