(VALID CLUES) Tj T*
(A clue is a single word. Not allowed: the mystery word in another language, an) Tj T*
(invented word, a word of the same family as the mystery word \(Prince for Princess\), or) Tj T*
(a word that sounds the same. Numbers, acronyms and symbols count as words.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(RESULT OF A GUESS) Tj T*
(- Correct: put the card face up in the success pile.) Tj T*
(- Wrong: discard the card and also the top card of the deck.) Tj T*
(- Skip: if unsure, the active player may skip; only that card is discarded.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCORING) Tj T*
(After the 13 cards are used, count the cards in the success pile: 13 is a perfect) Tj T*
(score.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WITH 3 PLAYERS) Tj T*
(Each non-active player writes two different clues on two easels.) Tj T*
ET
